  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "5A1F61160267AF3F",
      "text": "海岱没带钱包，\\n现在一定正在哭鼻子呢……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "5A1F62160267B0F2",
      "text": "拜托你穿过沙漠，\\n到[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]渍沁镇[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]后把钱包交给他吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "5A1F63160267B2A5",
      "text": "[EMPTY 67]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_01a",
      "hash64": "033215E8AA805C80",
      "text": "怎么？你又来了！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_26",
      "hash64": "93117A305CF60F00",
      "text": "吁～！\\n没了！真没了！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_27",
      "hash64": "93117B305CF610B3",
      "text": "钱包……没～了！！！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_28",
      "hash64": "931188305CF626CA",
      "text": "这样下去，\\n特卖商品会被别人买走的……[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_29",
      "hash64": "931189305CF6287D",
      "text": "……呜呜。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_01b",
      "hash64": "033218E8AA806199",
      "text": "大哥，你要冷静！\\n我跑一趟，马上找回它就是了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "0B79F51B0482ECC8",
      "text": "哦，你要怎样？\\n要是找海岱大哥有事的话，\\r\\n他现在正忙着呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "0B79F61B0482EE7B",
      "text": "要是想碍事的话，不管是谁，\\n我这个头号弟子都不会允许……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "0B79FB1B0482F6FA",
      "text": "还是说，即使你看我们这～么忙\\n……也还是有事要找我们吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_a",
      "hash64": "3ECD48AC469CDCAC",
      "text": "有事！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_b",
      "hash64": "3ECD4BAC469CE1C5",
      "text": "没事……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "0B79FC1B0482F8AD",
      "text": "那么，你就快回去！\\n我们可是很忙的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "0B79F91B0482F394",
      "text": "你这孩子真不懂事！\\n让你安静一点吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "0B79FA1B0482F547",
      "text": "怎么会这样！\\n我连私房钱都输了个精光！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "930AF5305CF0C153",
      "text": "嘿！吃了吗……\\n这么吵，出啥事了……？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "0B79EF1B0482E296",
      "text": "海、海岱大哥！\\n事情是这样的，这孩子……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "930AF6305CF0C306",
      "text": "有客人来找丢了钱包\\n身无分文的俺……？\\r\\n到底有啥事啊……？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "54C29DBBFD75281A",
      "text": "钱包！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "54C29CBBFD752667",
      "text": "你忘了这个！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "C22350BAFFC104CD",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]把海岱的钱包\\n交给了道馆馆主！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "930AF7305CF0C4B9",
      "text": "吁～！？\\n是俺的钱包！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "930AF8305CF0C66C",
      "text": "啥？是道馆前台的人\\n让你给俺送来的？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "930AF9305CF0C81F",
      "text": "啊、哈、哈！你帮了俺一个大忙！\\n特地让你跑一趟，多谢啦！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "930AFA305CF0C9D2",
      "text": "啊～还有，俺的小弟\\n给你添麻烦了，抱歉！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "930AFB305CF0CB85",
      "text": "在渍沁镇招牌的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]拍卖会[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]上\\n有俺们无论如何都想买的东西。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "930AFC305CF0CD38",
      "text": "所以俺跟他都很兴奋。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_shop_01",
      "hash64": "4C49FA89878568CE",
      "text": "来啊！瞧一瞧！看一看！\\n这是今天最后一件商品！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "930AFD305CF0CEEB",
      "text": "嗯……？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_shop_02",
      "hash64": "4C49F9898785671B",
      "text": "今天的特卖商品是这个！\\n丰缘地区产的传说的裙带菜！\\r\\n有没有？有没有？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "930E7A305CF3D929",
      "text": "吁、吁～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "930E79305CF3D776",
      "text": "俺不摸也能看出来的\\n那富含营养的弹力！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "930E78305CF3D5C3",
      "text": "那光彩四射，\\n耀眼夺目的色泽！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "930E77305CF3D410",
      "text": "还有既新鲜又醇厚，\\n来自海边的那股藏不住的芳香！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_14",
      "hash64": "930E7E305CF3DFF5",
      "text": "要～要的就是它～！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_15",
      "hash64": "930E7D305CF3DE42",
      "text": "俺说你啊，如果想挑战玻瓶道馆，\\n够不够洒脱是很重要的！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_16",
      "hash64": "930E7C305CF3DC8F",
      "text": "这是个好机会！\\n你就替俺拍下那个食材吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "54C29BBBFD7524B4",
      "text": "什么是拍卖？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_04",
      "hash64": "54C29ABBFD752301",
      "text": "我试试看！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_17",
      "hash64": "930E7B305CF3DADC",
      "text": "拍卖啊……就是通过和其他客人\\n竞拍来买东西的意思！\\c\\n在自己能拿得出手的范围内，\\n用更高的价格投标的人\\r\\n就能把商品买下！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
